(The LunarSafe system is organized into a modular, decoupled architecture consisting of four integrated layers: \(1\) The Ingestion & Pre-Processing Engine,) Tj
T* (\(2\) The Frozen Deterministic Core \(DeterministicLunarEngine\), \(3\) The Uncertainty & Conservative Hazard Classifier, and \(4\) The Cryptographic Audit and) Tj
T* (Dossier Packaging Layer. This separation guarantees that core physical determinations remain completely isolated from telemetry visualization, network) Tj
T* (transport, or secondary reporting services.) Tj
